    - rid: 3053703757883507127
      type: {class: NoteDef, ns: Game.Scripts.Notes, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        <Id>k__BackingField: Note01
        Title: 
        Text: 'After Incident X, which was your fault, you have been exiled to the old laboratory wing. No one has set foot here in years.

          

          Your task: clear the building of clutter and put everything in its proper place. Large items go on the pallets; small ones go on the shelves. Resources are stored separately, by the entrance.

          

          Some of the furniture has been destroyed, and you will have to repair it. Use whatever resources you find in the lab.

          

          Perhaps then you will earn back their trust.

          

          WARNING! UNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCES ARE YOU TO REPAIR THE TELEPORTER.'
        ButtonText: 
        ButtonActions:
          Actions: []
    - rid: 3053703757883507128
      type: {class: NoteDef, ns: Game.Scripts.Notes, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        <Id>k__BackingField: Note02
        Title: 
        Text: "...Marta's been strange today. She says she hears voices in her head. Maybe she's just tired \u2013 none of us have slept in a long time.\r\nIn the evening, she was sitting at the table, eating something. At first I didn't realize what it was. Then I noticed her whole hand was covered in blood. She smiled at me and said it tasted better than the canned food."
        ButtonText: OK?
        ButtonActions:
          Actions: []
    - rid: 3053703757883507129
      type: {class: NoteDef, ns: Game.Scripts.Notes, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        <Id>k__BackingField: Note03
        Title: 
        Text: "03:12 \u2014 Flash in Block B.\r\n03:16 \u2014 Comms down.\r\n03:17 \u2014 Something in the corr"
        ButtonText: 
        ButtonActions:
          Actions: []
    - rid: 3053703757883507130
      type: {class: NoteDef, ns: Game.Scripts.Notes, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        <Id>k__BackingField: Note_FakeLast
        Title: 
        Text: 'Can''t think. Nothing is where it should be, and it presses on me like noise in my head.

          I can''t focus until I clean up. I''ve tried. It doesn''t work.


          Need to clean up, clean up, clean up, <alpha=#CC>clean up, <alpha=#99>clean up, <alpha=#66>clean up, <alpha=#40>clean up, <alpha=#1A>clean up'
        ButtonText: End?
        ButtonActions:
          Actions:
          - Id: RestartGameAction
            Args: '{}'
    - rid: 3053703757883507131
      type: {class: NoteDef, ns: Game.Scripts.Notes, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        <Id>k__BackingField: Note_HeAteUs
        Title: 
        Text: 'I went hungry for so long, but now they''re talking inside my stomach, and I can hear them.

          Isaac keeps calling my name. He asks why it''s so dark. I don''t know what to tell him.'
        ButtonText: What?
        ButtonActions:
          Actions: []
    - rid: 3053703757883507132
      type: {class: NoteDef, ns: Game.Scripts.Notes, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        <Id>k__BackingField: Note_Last
        Title: 
        Text: 'Hey, me. You''re probably reading this note for the hundredth time...

          

          Listen, I know this is hard to wrap your head around. But there''s nothing up there. Just an endless nuclear wasteland. Not a single soul.

          

          You and a group of other scientists made it down to the underground lab in Block A_72.

          But unfortunately, one of the group was infected with some unknown virus.

          

          Somehow, you were the only one lucky enough to develop antibodies in time and survive.

          And for years now, you''ve been wandering the lab, not knowing what to do...'
        ButtonText: 
        ButtonActions:
          Actions:
          - Id: RestartGameAction
            Args: '{}'
